* ShadowStream
** Verify that DTX has been Provided
** Open them and verify that ImageManager is shown as an installed application from the dtx.log located in C:\ProgramData\dtx\logs in the .7z file
** Verify if this is an OEM License (OEM Support Contacts)
*** If OEM License verify that Email Domain matches the OEM
*** If Email Domain does not match OEM direct Partner to OEM for support
*** Incident Packs holders are entitled to STC support.
** Verify that the Serial Number has active maintenance in CPP and is a ShadowStream License
*** If expired, is there an Incident Pack referenced in the Web Form Incident field (e.g. XXXX-XXXX)
*** Verify that the Incident Pack is valid in CPP

